{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18767","headline":"连州腊日观莫徭腊西山 · 刘禹锡","name":"连州腊日观莫徭腊西山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海天杀气薄，蛮军步伍嚣。\n林红叶尽变，原黑草初烧。\n围合繁钲息，禽兴大斾摇。\n张罗依道口，嗾犬上山腰。\n猜鹰虑奋迅，惊鹿时局跳。\n瘴云四面起，腊雪半空消。\n箭头余鹄血，鞍傍见雉翘。\n日暮还城邑，金笳发丽谯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}